      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To implement the `score_image_safety.py` file, I need to integrate with a concrete external provider that can check an image for unsafe or policy-sensitive visual content. Given the requirements, I will use the Amazon Rekognition service, which is a powerful image and video analysis service that can detect unsafe content. I will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library, which is the Amazon Web Services (AWS) SDK for Python, to interact with the Rekognition service. The provider-identifying signal will be the import of the `boto3` library and the use of the `rekognition` client. </thinking>\n",
